2                       =TOTAL NUMBER OF LANDS (EXCLUSIVE OF GND PLANE)
30                      =NUMBER OF CONDUCTOR SUBSECTIONS
5.                      =LAND WIDTH (mils)
5.                      =EDGE-TO-EDGE LAND SEPARATION (mils)
20.                     =SEPARATION BETWEEN GROUND PLANES (mils)
4.7                     =BOARD RELATIVE DIELECTRIC CONSTANT
